es, in phases. Terminal 4 began opening on 27 September 2026 with Wizz Air, AJet and SalamAir, and other airlines have been moving since. It covers about 97,000 square metres and is designed for up to 15 million passengers a year."}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"border border-[#16A34A]/12 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-bold text-base mb-2 text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"Which terminal is the Hajj terminal at Jeddah airport?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed","children":"The Hajj and Umrah Terminal is a separate terminal for pilgrim flights, distinct from Terminal 4. Terminal 4 also has a dedicated group check-in area for pilgrims. Your airline confirms which one your flight uses."}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"border border-[#16A34A]/12 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-bold text-base mb-2 text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"How do I find my driver at Jeddah airport?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed","children":"Your driver provides meet and greet at arrivals. Share your flight number and the terminal your airline shows when you book, and tell us if it changes before you fly so the driver waits at the right place."}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"border border-[#16A34A]/12 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-bold text-base mb-2 text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"What happens if my flight to Jeddah is delayed?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed","children":"We track your flight, so a delay moves the pickup to your actual landing time. Free waiting of 15 to 30 minutes after landing applies, so you are not charged for the time it takes to clear immigration and collect bags."}]]}],"$L37","$L38"]}]]}]
